[P_11_KokuboSosho_BasementGuards]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=SOLDIER - Watch where you're point that thing.
Speech_0002L=SOLDIER - Ah... relax... it's non-lethal anyway.
Speech_0003L=SOLDIER - Yeah? You ever been hit by one of those?
Speech_0004L=SOLDIER - No...
Speech_0005L=SOLDIER - Well... Mamuro has... and I don't want to end up like him.
Speech_0006L=SOLDIER - Really?
Speech_0007L=SOLDIER - Hunh?
Speech_0008L=SOLDIER - See. It made him stupid.
Speech_0009L=SOLDIER - Mamoru... did you get shot with one of these?
Speech_0010L=SOLDIER - Uh...
Speech_0011L=SOLDIER - I told you... dumb as a sack of rice.
Speech_0012L=SOLDIER - Huh..huh... sack of rice... huh.

[P_11_KokuboSosho_BathroomGuard]

[P_11_KokuboSosho_Captured]

[P_11_KokuboSosho_CapturedDialog]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=SOLDIER - It looks like he's starting to regain consciousness...
Speech_0002L=COLONEL - Good...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0003L=SOLDIER - ...the Colonel would like to talk to you...
Speech_0004L=COLONEL - Again...
Speech_0005L=SOLDIER - Come on, American! Talk!
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0006L=COLONEL - ...how you got in here? You'll need to tell me something before I can begin to negotiate on your behalf... Sergeant.
Speech_0007L=COLONEL - Give him a little... extra, Sergeant...
Speech_0008L=SOLDIER - Yes sir.
Speech_0009L=SOLDIER - Come on, American. Make it easy on yourself. You do not want to know the other option...
Speech_0010L=SOLDIER - I don't think he's going to talk, sir.
Speech_0011L=COLONEL - I guess we'll have to do it the hard way. Dismissed.
Speech_0012L=SOLDIER - Yes sir.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0013L=COLONEL - Eighty-four kilograms... let's see...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0014L=COLONEL - Yes... this will make you talk...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0015L=COLONEL - We'll find out what you know.
Speech_0016L=SOLDIER - It looks like he's starting to regain consciousness...
Speech_0017L=COLONEL - Good...
Speech_0018L=SOLDIER - ...have hit him pretty hard...
Speech_0019L=COLONEL - Give him a minute... he'll come around.
Speech_0020L=COLONEL - ...hear me? Hello my friend? Are you there? Ah... he's not so tough...
Speech_0021L=COLONEL - How long does this typically take?
Speech_0022L=SOLDIER - Normally only a few minutes... but with an American...
Speech_0023L=COLONEL - I thought they were supposed to be stronger...
Speech_0024L=SOLDIER - Too much red meat... it might take longer than we thought.
Speech_0025L=COLONEL - Go inspect his equipment again. I'll wait here until he revives.
Speech_0026L=SOLDIER - Yes sir.
Speech_0027L=COLONEL - I wonder how he got in here?
Speech_0028L=COLONEL - Maybe he's a spy who's been stationed here all along?
Speech_0029L=COLONEL - Maybe he's not even American...

[P_11_KokuboSosho_Communications]
Speech_0126L=LAMBERT - State Department has lost contact with all of the US Officers who work at the Kokubo Sosho with the Japanese Self Defense Force. It looks like the SDF have taken them prisoner and they're refusing to answer our calls. In typical fashion, the Japanese are circling their wagons... either they're afraid to admit they've lost control of Otomo, or they're actually sanctioning him. If that's the case we'll have to come clean with North Korea, which will spark a massive war in Asia. If not... we need to find out what our officers know and figure out what to do about Otomo before North Korea finds out what's going on.
Speech_0127L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Sam, even if the Japanese government does not sanction him, Otomo still clearly has the capacity to strike. If he is still in control of the Information arm of the SDF, you'll need to deal with him very carefully. There is no telling what kind of havoc he could unleash.
Speech_0128L=REDDING - Last contact we had with any US personnel in the Kokubo Sosho was a fragment of a phonecall from Major Harper, a logistics advisor to G-SDF. Form the sounds of the call, the room he was in was raided by Japanese troops and he was taken prisoner. It doesn't sound like anyone has been killed... and if there is any hope of maintaining peaceful relations with the Japanese, you're going to have to keep it that way.
Speech_0184L=LAMBERT - Find the officers, but don't kill anyone, or I abort the mission immediately.
Speech_0001L=LAMBERT - Fisher, I can't stress this enough... if one Japanese soldier dies, we risk World War Three. Any fatalities and I abort the mission immediately.
Speech_0002L=FISHER - I understand.
Speech_0005L=LAMBERT - Locate our officers and find out what the hell is going on there.
Speech_0006L=FISHER - I'll find them.
POPUPMESSAGE_0183=Contact the detained American Officers.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0131L=LAMBERT - Find the officers, but don't kill anyone, or I abort the mission immediately.
Note_0160L=The basement access has just been unlocked.
Speech_0185L=LAMBERT - Fisher you need to record everything that happens in Japanese War Room in the sub levels under the main floor.
Speech_0007L=LAMBERT - Sam, we need to record everything that happens in that meeting so we can present it to the Joint Chiefs.
Speech_0008L=FISHER - Where is the War Room?
Speech_0009L=LAMBERT - In the sub-level beneath the main floor.
Speech_0010L=FISHER - It would speed things up if you let me remove some of the threats.
Speech_0011L=LAMBERT - Forget it Fisher. Until we know who the enemy is, there is no enemy. No enemy means no kills. Deal with it.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0132L=LAMBERT - Fisher you need to record everything that happens in Japanese War Room in the sub levels under the main floor.
Note_0162L=The SDF soldiers in the basement area are using non-lethal weaponry.
Speech_0186L=REDDING - Sam, it looks like these guards are carrying non-lethal ammo. Don't let them tag you... if you're taken prisoner... I don't even want to think about it.
Speech_0012L=REDDING - Fisher, from the looks of it these guards are LTL equipped.
Speech_0013L=FISHER - Less-Than-Lethal? Why?
Speech_0014L=REDDING - There's only one reason I can think of that they'd issue them to combat troops...  they'll want to interrogate anyone they catch.
Speech_0017L=FISHER - Well, I'm not the talkative type.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0157L=REDDING - Sam, it looks like these guards are carrying non-lethal ammo. Don't let them tag you... if you're taken prisoner... I don't even want to think about it.
Speech_0187L=LAMBERT - You just downloaded the orders for the I-SDF strike team that went after Shetland. This confirms Otomo's involvement... but we still need to discover if his actions are sanctioned by the government.
Speech_0076L=LAMBERT - Just as we suspected...
Speech_0077L=FISHER - That's a copy of the orders for the strike team sent to the Bath House.
Speech_0083L=LAMBERT - Yeah. Kaneda was working directly for Otomo... it confirms Otomo's involvement with Shetland and the Masse enabled attacks... but we still need to discover if his actions are sanctioned by the government.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0133L=LAMBERT - You just downloaded the orders for the I-SDF strike team that went after Shetland. This confirms Otomo's involvement... but we still need to discover if his actions are sanctioned by the government.
POPUPMESSAGE_0166=Record the meeting in the War Room.
Speech_0188L=LAMBERT - That double isolated room in the center of the corridors is the War Room, Sam. You'll need to find a way to record their meeting.
Speech_0027L=LAMBERT - Fisher, GPS shows you're nearing the War Room. Intelligence says it's a tempest-hardened cube... the only way you'll be able to record what's going on in there is to find some way inside.
Speech_0030L=FISHER - Tempest hardening might keep out electronic intruders, but I'm betting the room isn't air tight.
Speech_0084L=LAMBERT - Probably not.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0134L=LAMBERT - That double isolated room in the center of the corridors is the War Room, Sam. You'll need to find a way to record their meeting.
Speech_0189L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Sam, you should be able to laser mic the War Room from the vent overlooking it.
Speech_0108L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Sam, I've got some details on the building's infrastructure. This vent should come out directly over the War Room.
Speech_0109L=FISHER - I'll try and laser mic the meeting from there.
Speech_0110L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Good. We'll let you know when we have enough to make the Joint Chiefs happy.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0156L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Sam, you should be able to laser mic the War Room from the vent overlooking it.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0031L=LAMBERT - Good god Fisher... that confirms it. Otomo has been manipulating the Japanese government the entire time.
Speech_0032L=FISHER - At least they're not sanctioning his actions... What's the next step? How do we stop Otomo?
Speech_0033L=LAMBERT - If we're lucky we might not have to...
Speech_0085L=FISHER - What do you mean?
Speech_0086L=LAMBERT - Grim...
Speech_0034L=GRIMSDOTTIR - I'm worried about that General, Fisher... he's been awfully quiet working on his laptop... access it from here... let's see what he's planning.
POPUPMESSAGE_0167=Access the G-SDF General's laptop.
Speech_0089L=FISHER - Will do.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0135L=LAMBERT - Otomo has been manipulating the Japanese government. We need to know what's next.
Speech_0136L=GRIMSDOTTIR - The General in the War Room is up to something... access his laptop from the vent overlooking the room.
POPUPMESSAGE_0178=Access the G-SDF General's laptop.
Note_0161L=The ISDF elevator is now accessible.
Speech_0190L=LAMBERT - Otomo is going to force launch North Korean ballistic missiles at Japan. We need to destroy his severs in the Command Center at the bottom of the elevator.
Speech_0035L=LAMBERT - Good lord! Otomo is going to launch a North Korean missile at his own country!
Speech_0038L=FISHER - What's the time frame?
Speech_0039L=LAMBERT - Could be hours, could be minutes. Get down there and destroy his servers.
POPUPMESSAGE_0168=Cripple Otomo's I-SDF servers.
Speech_0040L=FISHER - What about extraction?
Speech_0114L=LAMBERT - If you can't take out those servers before Otomo forces a launch there won't be any reason to extract...
Speech_0115L=FISHER - And if I do take out the servers?
Speech_0116L=LAMBERT - We'll make that part up as we go.
Speech_0117L=FISHER - That's half a plan if I've ever heard one...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0137L=LAMBERT - Otomo is going to force launch North Korean ballistic missiles at Japan. We need to destroy his severs in the Command Center at the bottom of the elevator.
POPUPMESSAGE_0179=Cripple Otomo's I-SDF servers.
Speech_0191L=LAMBERT - Fisher... if you're sure you're okay... continue the mission as planned... but be careful... the base is on alert.
Speech_0090L=LAMBERT - Come in Fisher! Come in!
Speech_0091L=FISHER - I'm... I'm okay Lambert... Non-lethal round... they were planning on interrogating me...
Speech_0094L=LAMBERT - They couldn't have had time to... you were only gone for a couple of minutes...
Speech_0095L=FISHER - Good... where were we?
Note_0194L=Enemies have fortified their positions
POPUPMESSAGE_0173=Alarm Stage Four - Full Alert - Enemies Fortifying Positions
Speech_0096L=LAMBERT - Well, the whole facility is on alert, are you sure you're okay to continue the mission?
Speech_0097L=FISHER - Now that you mention it, maybe I could use a week on the beach, instead.
Speech_0118L=LAMBERT - You'll have it... as soon as we find out what's happening in the War Room.
Speech_0119L=FISHER - I'm on my way.
Speech_0120L=LAMBERT - You'll have it... as soon as you're finished in the Command Center.
Speech_0121L=FISHER - I'm on my way.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0152L=LAMBERT - Fisher... if you're sure you're okay... continue the mission as planned... but be careful... the base is on alert.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0052L=LAMBERT - I just got off the horn with the Joint Chiefs... I'm lifting the non-lethal mission parameter. Fifth Freedom with everyone except Otomo.
Speech_0053L=FISHER - You're kidding me...
Speech_0054L=LAMBERT - We need to capture him alive. His profile is pretty clear. He won't lie to a war crimes tribunal in face of the evidence. It would offend his sense of honor.
POPUPMESSAGE_0169=Capture Otomo alive.
Speech_0055L=FISHER - You need him to take responsibility so the rest of Japan is off the hook with North Korea...
Speech_0056L=LAMBERT - Exactly. If Otomo dies... we're right back at square one. Bring him in breathing.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0138L=LAMBERT - Fisher, the Joint Chiefs need Otomo alive at any cost. Fifth Freedom with everyone but him. Your non-lethal parameter is lifted.
POPUPMESSAGE_0180=Capture Otomo alive.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0103L=LAMBERT - Fisher! North Korea just contacted NORAD and the President... they report that they've lost control of a launch facility! They can't abort and they're not sure they can destroy the missile on time...
Speech_0104L=FISHER - How long?
Speech_0105L=LAMBERT - They say three minutes until it's away!
Speech_0106L=FISHER - I think I can reach the server in time.
Speech_0107L=LAMBERT - Hurry up!
POPUPMESSAGE_0182=Cripple Otomo's I-SDF servers.
Speech_0139L=LAMBERT - They say two and a half minutes until it's away!
Speech_0140L=LAMBERT - They say two minutes until it's away!
Speech_0141L=LAMBERT - They say ninety seconds until it's away!
POPUPMESSAGE_0170=Cripple Otomo's I-SDF servers.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0142L=LAMBERT - They say sixty seconds until it's away!
POPUPMESSAGE_0171=Cripple Otomo's I-SDF servers.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0165L=LAMBERT - Hurry up!
Speech_0143L=LAMBERT - They say thirty seconds until it's away!
Speech_0192L=LAMBERT - Well done, now get to Otomo.
Speech_0063L=LAMBERT - Thank god Fisher! That aborted the launch.
Speech_0064L=FISHER - Yeah... but I think it woke up the neighbors...
Speech_0065L=LAMBERT - Get through them, Fisher, then bring in Otomo alive.
POPUPMESSAGE_0172=Capture Otomo alive.
Speech_0066L=FISHER - My pleasure.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0144L=LAMBERT - Well done, now get to Otomo.
POPUPMESSAGE_0181=Capture Otomo alive.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0102L=LAMBERT - My god Fisher... the missile is away. The time for spying is over. We're at war.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0153L=LAMBERT - Good thinking, Fisher.
Speech_0154L=FISHER - Any line in on what's going on in this place can only help.
Speech_0155L=LAMBERT - Absolutely.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0067L=LAMBERT - Now what?
Speech_0068L=FISHER - I think someone is taking himself a bit too seriously...
Speech_0069L=LAMBERT - We can't afford to let him die, Fisher! Get in there and stabilize him... fast!
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0145L=LAMBERT - Otomo just tried to commit seppuku Get in there and stabilize him, fast.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0070L=LAMBERT - Good work, Fisher, he's stable... but we still have to get him out of there... You're going to have to blast your way out.
Speech_0098L=FISHER - We're over a hundred feet underwater!
Speech_0099L=LAMBERT - You're not pressurized Fisher... it will be a shock... but you won't get the bends...
Speech_0100L=FISHER - Next time... you're going on the mission and I'm making up the crazy plan.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0146L=LAMBERT - Otomo should survive. Blast your way out and we'll pick you up from the surface.
POPUPMESSAGE_0174=Alarm Stage One
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0147L=LAMBERT - Be more careful, Fisher, this mission couldn't be more sensitive.
POPUPMESSAGE_0175=Alarm Stage Two - Enemies Equipping Body Armor
Note_0195L=Enemies are wearing body armor
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0148L=LAMBERT - That's two alarms, Sam... why not just tell everyone you're there.
POPUPMESSAGE_0176=Alarm Stage Three - Enemies Equipping Helmets
Note_0196L=Enemies are wearing helmets
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0149L=LAMBERT - Dammit Fisher! You're going to rekindle this war single-handedly if you're not more careful!
Speech_0158L=LAMBERT - Dammit Fisher... be careful with the alarms.
POPUPMESSAGE_0177=Alarm Stage Four - Full Alert - Enemies Fortifying Positions
Note_0197L=Enemies have fortified their positions
Speech_0193L=LAMBERT - Fisher, the base is on alert.
Speech_0080L=LAMBERT - Oh god, the whole facility is on alerted...
Speech_0081L=FISHER - Does my mission change?
Speech_0082L=LAMBERT - Your objectives stay the same Sam... you're our only chance.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0151L=LAMBERT - Fisher, the base is on alert.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0122L=LAMBERT - Dammit Sam! I told you to save him!
Speech_0123L=FISHER - He was dead already...
Speech_0124L=LAMBERT - There was still time to get him medical attention... now we're at war with Korea for sure. Mission Over!
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0125L=LAMBERT - Dammit Sam! We needed intelligence from those boys... now we'll never know what's going on. Get out of there. Mission Over!
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0113L=LAMBERT - Dammit, Sam! Not only did I say no fatalities... but that was one of our own officers! Mission Over!
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0073L=LAMBERT - God dammit, Fisher!? Can't you follow orders?
Speech_0074L=FISHER - Lambert... I...
Speech_0075L=LAMBERT - That's it Fisher... Mission Over!

