[P_11_KokuboSosho_InterroBasement]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Nice toy. What kind of ammo does it use?
Speech_0004L=SOLDIER - How about you let me go and I'll show you?
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Don't get smart...
Speech_0006L=SOLDIER - Aaarghh... okay... it's... some kind of shock round... electric...
Speech_0007L=FISHER - Interesting... you have any extra?
Speech_0008L=SOLDIER - It's not like you can shake me and make my ammo fall on the floor to pick up...
Speech_0009L=FISHER - You're awfully flippant for someone with a knife to his throat...
Speech_0010L=SOLDIER - Aghh... okay... I think they keep some extras in the store room.
Note_0016L=Sticky shocker rounds can be found in the store room.
Speech_0013L=SOLDIER - Please don't kill me... you said yourself, I'm smart...
Speech_0014L=SOLDIER - Could you not hold the knife so close please...

[P_11_KokuboSosho_InterroCapturers]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Bad news, Colonel.
Speech_0002L=COLONEL - Ah! How did you get free?
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Listen, I'm not feeling too good right now... under any other circumstance, I'd jump at the chance to cut you a second smile...
Speech_0006L=COLONEL - Please, don't kill me American...
Speech_0014L=FISHER - I have orders not to...  but I can still hurt you pretty bad if I feel like it. How many more men do you have down here?
Speech_0010L=COLONEL - I didn't call any more reinforcements... the Captain needed more men downstairs... no one was expecting you.
Speech_0016L=FISHER - So it's just your buddy outside the door?
Speech_0017L=COLONEL - Yeah...
Speech_0012L=COLONEL - I was careless...
Speech_0013L=COLONEL - A minute more and I'd have started with the leeches...

[P_11_KokuboSosho_InterroFirstTunnel]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Excuse me... I need directions...
Speech_0002L=SOLDIER - Wh - ah! Ok...
Speech_0003L=FISHER - I'm the good guy who's here to save the world.
Speech_0004L=SOLDIER - I... I thought I was the good guy...
Speech_0005L=FISHER - No, no. You're on the team with the super-secret underground base. I'm the guy breaking into the base. That makes me the good guy. Now tell me how I get in.
Speech_0006L=SOLDIER - There's a ladder in the electrical room... you can probably find a way in from there... into the bathrooms...
Note_0016L=There is a way to reach the bathrooms from the tunnel's electrical room.
Speech_0013L=SOLDIER - I once saw a cat around the cables over there...
Speech_0014L=SOLDIER - Did you try the doorbell on the front door?

[P_11_KokuboSosho_InterroHostagers]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Why are you holding these men?
Speech_0002L=SOLDIER - Wha? Who?
Speech_0003L=FISHER - Answer the question.
Speech_0004L=SOLDIER - Those are my orders...
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Whose orders?
Speech_0006L=SOLDIER - Wh... what? The General...
Speech_0007L=FISHER - General? Don't you mean Admiral?
Speech_0008L=SOLDIER- What do you mean?
Speech_0025L=FISHER - Your orders? Do they come from Admiral Otomo, or not?
Speech_0026L=SOLDIER - No.
Speech_0010L=SOLDIER - They're not hostages... we're just... detaining them.
Speech_0011L=SOLDIER - We have orders not to shoot them... just hold them here...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0012L=FISHER - I need information.
Speech_0013L=SOLDIER - You'll get nothing form me.
Speech_0014L=FISHER - Wrong.
Speech_0015L=SOLDIER - Agh...
Speech_0016L=FISHER - Where's the War Room?
Speech_0017L=SOLDIER - In the sub-levels. The sealed door from the lobby...
Speech_0018L=FISHER - How do I open the sealed door?
Speech_0019L=SOLDIER - It should be open... a Captain came by to hand pick some men for a mission?
Speech_0023L=FISHER - What mission?
Speech_0024L=SOLDIER - I have no idea... he didn't want me...
Speech_0020L=SOLDIER - It's my first day...
Speech_0021L=SOLDIER - I didn't hurt them... please go easy on me...

[P_11_KokuboSosho_InterroISDF]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0003L=FISHER - Where's Otomo?
Speech_0004L=SOLDIER - Secured in his office... you'll never get to him...
Speech_0005L=FISHER - Fine... where's his server...
Speech_0006L=SOLDIER - Just there... but it's too late... he's initiated the launch...
Speech_0007L=FISHER - There's no way to stop it?
Speech_0008L=SOLDIER - Not without destroying the servers...
Speech_0024L=FISHER - Well... fortunately, I don't have a problem with that.
Speech_0009L=SOLDIER - It doesn't matter... you'll die down here.
Speech_0010L=SOLDIER - You'll never defeat the Admiral.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0012L=FISHER - Tell me how to get into Otomo's office.
Speech_0013L=SOLDIER - Never!
Speech_0014L=FISHER - I have orders to take him alive... but it's a different story for you...
Speech_0015L=SOLDIER - Please! no!
Speech_0016L=FISHER - You're getting closer and closer to dead...
Speech_0017L=SOLDIER - Under the floors... I think there's a way. But Otomo will never surrender...
Note_0025L=There may be a way to reach Otomo's office under the floors.
Speech_0018L=FISHER -We'll see about that.
Speech_0021L=SOLDIER - This shall be your tomb American...
Speech_0023L=SOLDIER - Admiral Otomo will never be taken alive...

[P_11_KokuboSosho_InterroMainLobby]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Nice building.
Speech_0002L=SOLDIER - Wha! Who?
Speech_0003L=FISHER - I'm going to suggest they hire your designer to do some work on the Pentagon.
Speech_0004L=SOLDIER - What do you want...
Speech_0005L=FISHER - A news update, what's happening here tonight?
Speech_0006L=SOLDIER - What? I know nothing!
Speech_0007L=FISHER - You probably know more than you think... just talk.
Speech_0008L=SOLDIER - Uh... some men have been moved around... guarding inside. A Captain was here earlier mustering volunteers... not sure what for.
Speech_0009L=SOLDIER - Some suits and officials came in for an emergency meeting.
Speech_0011L=SOLDIER - I should have stayed home tonight, it was karaoke night...

[P_11_KokuboSosho_InterroServers]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Tight security you have down here...
Speech_0002L=SOLDIER - Not tight enough apparently...
Speech_0003L=FISHER - Tell me something that'll help me get around here more easily...
Speech_0006L=SOLDIER - Okay, okay... we recently set up some IR cameras...
Note_0015L=There are IR cameras set up in the server room.
Speech_0007L=FISHER - Yeah...
Speech_0008L=SOLDIER - There's IR sensors too, around the war room...
Note_0016L=Laser sensors are active around the War Room.
Speech_0009L=FISHER - Is that so? Anything else?
Speech_0010L=SOLDIER - I'm not sure what kind of security they may have down in the lower sub-levels though...
Speech_0012L=SOLDIER - I thought I'd be safer working with computers...
Speech_0013L=SOLDIER - You're hurting me...

[P_11_KokuboSosho_InterroWarRoom]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0003L=FISHER - How do I get into the War Room?
Speech_0004L=SOLDIER - They seal the door from the inside... unless you have an industrial laser...
Speech_0005L=FISHER - I hope for your sake you have a better idea...
Speech_0006L=SOLDIER - Arrghh... god... please... wait... there... there's an air vent over the room... maybe you can see in from there.
Speech_0007L=FISHER - I'll have a look. You wait here.
Speech_0008L=SOLDIER - Oh... okay.
Speech_0012L=SOLDIER - Who are you anyway?
Speech_0013L=SOLDIER - Are you Korean?
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0014L=FISHER - Stay still and you won't get hurt.
Speech_0015L=SOLDIER - Deal.
Speech_0016L=FISHER - I need to get to the I-SDF Command Center...
Speech_0017L=SOLDIER - The elevator just outside of here... you can't miss it...
Speech_0018L=FISHER - Wanna come with me? I'd like a guide...
Speech_0019L=SOLDIER - Are you crazy... they have elite troops down there... a lot scarier than you!
Speech_0022L=SOLDIER - Good luck if you're going down there.
Speech_0024L=SOLDIER - It goes pretty deep too...

[P_11_KokuboSosho_LobbyConversatio]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=SOLDIER - Working late?
Speech_0002L=SOLDIER - Working? Are you kidding? This job is a joke.
Speech_0003L=SOLDIER - What are you talking about? We're here to defend--
Speech_0004L=SOLDIER - Defend the Kokubo Sosho? Yeah... right. That's like defending the CIA building or something...
Speech_0005L=SOLDIER - What do you mean?
Speech_0006L=SOLDIER - Well, it's not like anybody's crazy enough to bust in here... this is the easiest job in the world.

[P_11_KokuboSosho_Missile]

[P_11_KokuboSosho_NoKill]

[P_11_KokuboSosho_Objectives]
Objective_0007=Contact the detained American Officers.
Objective_0022=American Officers stationed at the Kokubo Sosho have been detained by the SDF in the Press Room on the top floor over the main lobby. Contact them for information.
Objective_0005=Do not kill anyone.
Objective_0023=Relations with Japan are at the breaking point. Killing anyone will result in Mission Failure.
POPUPMESSAGE_0031=Do not kill anyone.
POPUPMESSAGE_0034=Contact the detained American Officers.
POPUPMESSAGE_0035=Gain Access to the War Room.
Objective_0008=Find out who gave the I-SDF assault team their orders.
Objective_0024=Cover up any loose ends and discover who was in command of the I-SDF team that met with Shetland in the bathhouse.
POPUPMESSAGE_0036=Record the meeting in the War Room.
Objective_0009=Record the meeting in the War Room.
Objective_0025=The heads of the Self Defense Force are holding an emergency meeting in the War Room on the lower level. Record the meeting with your laser mic.
Objective_0037=Gain Access to the War Room.
Objective_0038=The sealed doors to the Kokubo Sosho War Room can be unlocked from the main server room in the lower level.
POPUPMESSAGE_0032=Gain Access to the War Room.
Objective_0010=Access the G-SDF General's laptop.
Objective_0026=Use your EEV to access the laptop of the General in the War Room from the overlooking vent.
Objective_0011=Cripple Otomo's I-SDF servers.
Objective_0027=Get to the I-SDF command center in the sub-levels and destroy Otomo's servers before it is too late.
Objective_0017=Capture Otomo alive.
Objective_0028=Fifth Freedom. The non-lethal restriction is lifted for anyone except Admiral Otomo, who must be captured alive if there is any hope to stabilize the region.
Objective_0020=Exfiltrate to the only available extraction point.
Objective_0029=The only possible extraction is through the wall of Otomo's office and into Tokyo bay. Use a charge to blast through the wall and get Otomo to the surface for medical attention.
POPUPMESSAGE_0033=Exfiltrate to the only available extraction point.
Objective_0021=Access the I-SDF servers.
Objective_0030=(null)

[P_11_KokuboSosho_ODell]

[P_11_KokuboSosho_OfficersTalk]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0002L=SOLDIER - You stay in this room and keep quiet!
Speech_0003L=OFFICER - We didn't say anything.
Speech_0004L=SOLDIER - Keep it that way. I have orders not to shoot you, but I have orders not to let you escape... let's not find out which order is more important.
Speech_0011L=OFFICER - We're not soldiers... we're just... desk jockey's... we're perfectly comfortable here.
Speech_0012L=SOLDIER - And no going to the bathroom!
Speech_0013L=OFFICER - Okay... fine... we can hold it... we'll be right here.
Speech_0014L=SOLDIER - Yes! You will!

