[P_11_KokuboSosho_Security]
Note_0002L=The keycode to the server room is 1945.
Note_0005L=The central servers will sink into the floor in case of alarm.
Note_0004L=The server room retinal scanner will cause the servers to resurface.
Note_0003L=There is a medical kit in the basement bathroom.
Note_0006L=There is a medical kit near the main lobby bathrooms.

[P_11_KokuboSosho_SRCfirst]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=SOLDIER - Did you hear the news? The rescue was successful...
Speech_0002L=SOLDIER - You're kidding me?
Speech_0003L=SOLDIER - No. That Chinese guy... he space walked over, tethered his capsule to the station, then brought back the other two astronauts one at a time.
Speech_0004L=SOLDIER - Wow... that's amazing...
Speech_0005L=SOLDIER - I'll say...
Speech_0006L=SOLDIER - So... what went wrong this time?
Speech_0007L=SOLDIER - Nothing. Nothing went wrong. Reentry went off without a hitch. They recovered the capsule form the ocean about an hour ago... the astronauts are a bit dehydrated... but that's it.
Speech_0008L=SOLDIER - Huh. So that's the end of the story...
Speech_0009L=SOLDIER - That's the end of the story.
Speech_0010L=SOLDIER - Go Taikonauts.

[P_11_KokuboSosho_SRCsecond]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=SOLDIER - I'm getting hungry.
Speech_0002L=SOLDIER - Me too... go tell Elie... we should order some dinner in for the guys who are working late.
Speech_0003L=SOLDIER - Can't.
Speech_0004L=SOLDIER - Why not?
Speech_0005L=SOLDIER - They transferred him. We're on our own.
Speech_0006L=SOLDIER - They transferred Elie? What are they thinking?
Speech_0007L=SOLDIER - Thinking? Ha! What are you talking about? Thinking... no one around here thinks... pffft...

[P_11_KokuboSosho_SRCthird]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=SOLDIER - Do you have any idea what's going on around here?
Speech_0002L=SOLDIER - What do you mean?
Speech_0003L=SOLDIER - I mean... there's been a lot of strange things happening in the last few hours?
Speech_0004L=SOLDIER - What... you mean taking the Americans prisoner... the suits rushing in for an emergency meeting... the Captain coming through and hand-picking an assault team... rumors of an infiltration... Admiral Otomo simply dropping off the face of the earth while the rest of the world hurtles toward the apocalypse...
Speech_0005L=SOLDIER - Yeah... what's going on with all of that?
Speech_0006L=SOLDIER - I try not to ask questions.

[P_11_KokuboSosho_USOfficers]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Psst...
Speech_0002L=OFFICER - Wh? Hey... you... you're American!
Speech_0003L=FISHER - Maybe... but I'm not here to rescue you.
Speech_0004L=OFFICER - That's okay. We're not really hostages anyway.
Speech_0005L=FISHER - What's going on?
Speech_0006L=OFFICER - Not too sure. SDF rounded up all the US personnel and locked us up. We saw some Generals and Ministers being brought in earlier.
Speech_0007L=FISHER - Where did they go?
Speech_0016L=OFFICER - Into the  War Room in the sub level.
Speech_0017L=FISHER - Hmm... the doors to the lower levels are sealed.
Speech_0018L=OFFICER - A Captain was just up here looking for combat ready volunteers to go down there... maybe the doors are open now?
Speech_0019L=FISHER - Perfect timing. Somebody will come for you later.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0008L=FISHER - Alright guys... what's going on here?
Speech_0009L=OFFICER - Thank god, an American. Ready to go when you are.
Speech_0010L=FISHER - Slow down... I'm not your baby sitter. Tell me what you know and maybe someone will come get you later.
Speech_0011L=OFFICER - Uh... well, SDF rounded up all the US personnel and locked us up. We saw some Generals and Ministers being brought in earlier.
Speech_0012L=FISHER - Where did they go?
Speech_0013L=OFFICER - Into the  War Room in the sub level.
Speech_0014L=FISHER - Hmm... the doors to the lower levels are sealed.
Speech_0015L=OFFICER - A Captain was just up here looking for combat ready volunteers to go down there... maybe the doors are open now?
Speech_0020L=FISHER - Thanks for the tip.

