[P_11_KokuboSosho_WarRoomEvent]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0020L=BUREAUCRAT - We cannot... but if he has control... where does that leave us... political suicide... we've already taken the Americans.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0021L=BUREAUCRAT - What is he thinking... no alternative... he'll die first, I'm sure...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0022L=TECHNICIAN - The line is secure... yes... we're ready to connect... I can patch him through... yes...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=TECHNICIAN - Sir. Here's Admiral Otomo...
Speech_0002L=BUREAUCRAT - Admiral... what is the meaning of this?
Speech_0031L=BUREAUCRAT - This is... this is impossible... even if we repeal the Constitution the Emperor would never--
Speech_0016L=BUREAUCRAT - Ninety... the people will never allow it.
Speech_0018L=TECHNICIAN - That's it... he cut the signal.
Speech_0019L=BUREAUCRAT - My God!
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0023L=BUREAUCRAT - My god... we're doomed... we can't do that... we can't tell the Americans... it cannot fail... he's lost his mind...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0024L=BUREAUCRAT - What do we do? What are our options? Can we retake the Command Center? What if it fails? Do we have another choice?
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0025L=TECHNICIAN - Trying to reconnect... Ops this is central... we have your feed... the General is almost ready...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0026L=TECHNICIAN - The Admiral again, sir.
Speech_0027L=BUREAUCRAT - Admiral... we...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0029L=BUREAUCRAT - My god... we're doomed... we can't do that... we can't tell the Americans... it cannot fail... he's lost his mind...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0030L=BUREAUCRAT - What do we do? What are our options? Do we have another choice? Seventy-two hours? How do we contact the Emperor?
